WEBVTT

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.500
Alissa
by C. J. MOORE

00:19.000 --> 00:21.500
Alissa is reading.  

00:21.600 --> 00:24.000
Her father calls to her.

00:24.100 --> 00:26.800
Alissa? Alissa?

00:27.000 --> 00:28.950
Alissa runs to the door.

00:29.000 --> 00:31.500
There is a car outside the house.

00:32.000 --> 00:35.000
Her father is talking to a fat man.

00:35.100 --> 00:39.500
"This is Alissa. She reads all day."

00:39.600 --> 00:43.500
Her father says. The two men laugh.

00:44.000 --> 00:47.800
HHHHHHH... Alissa?

00:47.900 --> 00:52.500
Her father says, "My friend has work for you in the city."

00:52.600 --> 00:57.950
"There isn't any work here in the village. You must go with him."

00:58.000 --> 01:01.950
The fat man smiles at Alissa.

01:02.000 --> 01:03.950
How old are you?

01:04.000 --> 01:05.950
He asks.

01:06.000 --> 01:06.950
I'm 12.

01:07.000 --> 01:10.950
She says. The fat man laughs again.

01:11.000 --> 01:15.950
Alissa doesn't like him. She doesn't want to go with this man.

01:16.000 --> 01:18.950
She wants to go to school in the village.

01:19.000 --> 01:22.950
She likes school. She likes reading.

01:23.000 --> 01:25.950
Your mother is packing your things.

01:26.000 --> 01:29.950
You must go to the city, her father says.

01:30.000 --> 01:33.950
The fat man gives some money to Alissa's father.

01:34.000 --> 01:36.950
Alissa's father is pleased and happy.

01:37.000 --> 01:40.950
Alissa is angry and afraid.

01:41.000 --> 01:49.950
Alissa does not want to go with this man, but she must obey her father.

01:50.000 --> 01:53.950
Alissa and the fat man arrive in the city.

01:54.000 --> 01:55.950
They drive to a house.

01:56.000 --> 01:58.950
A thin man comes to the door.

01:59.000 --> 02:00.950
The two men talk.

02:01.000 --> 02:02.950
Here is your room.

02:03.000 --> 02:05.950
The thin man says to Alissa.

02:06.000 --> 02:08.950
He points to a door under the steps.

02:09.000 --> 02:11.950
Alissa goes into the room.

02:12.000 --> 02:14.950
The room is small and dark.

02:15.000 --> 02:17.950
It is her new home.

02:18.000 --> 02:21.950
The next morning, the thin man takes Alissa into the house.

02:22.000 --> 02:23.950
This is Alissa.

02:24.000 --> 02:25.950
The man says to his wife.

02:26.000 --> 02:27.950
She likes reading.

02:28.000 --> 02:29.950
They laugh.

02:30.000 --> 02:32.950
Hahaha.

02:33.000 --> 02:35.950
Suddenly, the woman shouts at Alissa.

02:36.000 --> 02:38.950
You aren't going to read here.

02:39.000 --> 02:39.950
She shouts.

02:40.000 --> 02:43.950
You're going to cook and clean and wash.

02:44.000 --> 02:47.950
Alissa works 15 hours a day.

02:48.000 --> 02:50.950
The woman shouts at her every day.

02:51.000 --> 02:52.950
Alissa is very unhappy.

02:53.000 --> 02:57.950
She cries every night.

02:58.000 --> 03:00.950
One day, the thin man says to Alissa.

03:01.000 --> 03:02.950
Pack your things.

03:03.000 --> 03:04.950
You must go.

03:05.000 --> 03:06.950
My wife doesn't like you.

03:07.000 --> 03:10.950
The thin man takes her to a clothes shop in the city.

03:11.000 --> 03:13.950
The shop owner is a large woman.

03:14.000 --> 03:16.950
She gives the man some money.

03:17.000 --> 03:18.950
He goes away.

03:19.000 --> 03:22.000
He doesn't say goodbye to Alissa.

03:28.000 --> 03:30.950
Alissa works with five other girls.

03:31.000 --> 03:34.950
They work in a small, dark room.

03:35.000 --> 03:37.950
The girls work all day.

03:38.000 --> 03:39.950
They make clothes.

03:40.000 --> 03:42.950
They work 12 hours a day.

03:43.000 --> 03:46.950
At midday, they eat lunch.

03:47.000 --> 03:50.950
After lunch, they rest for 10 minutes.

03:51.000 --> 03:54.000
At night, they sleep on the floor.

03:58.000 --> 04:02.950
Each month, the shop owner gives the girls a little money.

04:03.000 --> 04:06.950
Alissa buys a book with her money.

04:07.000 --> 04:09.950
She reads the book after lunch.

04:10.000 --> 04:12.950
The shop owner is surprised.

04:13.000 --> 04:15.950
The other girls can't read.

04:16.000 --> 04:17.950
Can you write?

04:18.000 --> 04:19.950
Can you count?

04:20.000 --> 04:21.950
The shop owner asks.

04:22.000 --> 04:23.950
Yes, I can.

04:24.000 --> 04:25.950
Alissa says.

04:26.000 --> 04:26.950
Come.

04:27.000 --> 04:29.950
The shop owner says.

04:30.000 --> 04:33.000
You are going to work in the shop.

04:37.000 --> 04:39.950
Alissa likes working in the shop.

04:40.000 --> 04:42.950
She serves the customers.

04:43.000 --> 04:45.950
The customers are rich ladies.

04:46.000 --> 04:49.950
They buy expensive dresses.

04:50.000 --> 04:53.950
One of the customers is a tall and pretty lady.

04:54.000 --> 04:57.950
She always smiles at Alissa.

04:58.000 --> 05:01.000
She gives Alissa small presents.

05:02.000 --> 05:06.950
One day, the tall lady leaves her purse in the shop.

05:07.000 --> 05:09.950
Alissa runs out into the street.

05:10.000 --> 05:12.950
She runs after the lady.

05:13.000 --> 05:14.950
Here is your purse.

05:15.000 --> 05:16.950
Alissa says.

05:17.000 --> 05:18.950
The lady smiles.

05:19.000 --> 05:21.950
She takes the money from the purse.

05:22.000 --> 05:22.950
Thank you.

05:23.000 --> 05:24.950
She says to Alissa.

05:25.000 --> 05:28.000
You are an honest girl.

05:29.000 --> 05:30.950
Take this money.

05:31.000 --> 05:31.950
No.

05:32.000 --> 05:32.950
No.

05:33.000 --> 05:33.950
Says Alissa.

05:34.000 --> 05:35.950
I don't want your money.

05:36.000 --> 05:38.950
She runs back to the shop.

05:39.000 --> 05:41.950
The shop owner shouts at her.

05:42.000 --> 05:43.950
Don't leave the shop again.

05:44.000 --> 05:44.950
She shouts.

05:45.000 --> 05:46.950
I pay you a lot of money.

05:47.000 --> 05:48.950
I pay you to work.

05:49.000 --> 05:52.000
I don't pay you to run out into the street.

05:53.000 --> 05:54.950
Alissa is angry.

05:55.000 --> 05:57.950
You don't pay me a lot of money.

05:58.000 --> 05:58.950
She shouts.

05:59.000 --> 06:00.950
I'm a slave here.

06:01.000 --> 06:02.950
You're an ungrateful girl.

06:03.000 --> 06:04.950
The large woman says.

06:05.000 --> 06:07.950
You have a bed and food and money.

06:08.000 --> 06:09.950
Do you want more?

06:10.000 --> 06:11.950
Yes, I do.

06:12.000 --> 06:12.950
Alissa says.

06:13.000 --> 06:14.950
She is crying now.

06:15.000 --> 06:16.950
Wait.

06:17.000 --> 06:19.000
A quiet voice.

06:20.000 --> 06:20.950
Wait.

06:21.000 --> 06:22.950
A quiet voice says.

06:23.000 --> 06:25.950
The tall lady is standing at the door.

06:26.000 --> 06:28.950
Alissa isn't ungrateful.

06:29.000 --> 06:30.950
The tall lady says.

06:31.000 --> 06:33.950
She is an honest girl.

06:34.000 --> 06:36.950
The tall lady speaks to Alissa.

06:37.000 --> 06:38.950
Aren't you happy here?

06:39.000 --> 06:39.950
She asks.

06:40.000 --> 06:41.950
What do you want?

06:42.000 --> 06:43.950
Alissa says.

06:44.000 --> 06:47.000
I want to go to school.

06:50.000 --> 06:52.950
The tall lady turns to the shop owner.

06:53.000 --> 06:55.950
Alissa will live in my house.

06:56.000 --> 06:56.950
She says.

06:57.000 --> 06:58.950
She won't work.

06:59.000 --> 07:00.950
She will go to school.

07:01.000 --> 07:02.950
You must pay me.

07:03.000 --> 07:03.950
The shop owner says.

07:04.000 --> 07:04.950
No.

07:05.000 --> 07:06.950
The tall lady says.

07:07.000 --> 07:09.950
Alissa isn't a slave.

07:10.000 --> 07:11.950
Pack your things, Alissa.

07:12.000 --> 07:12.950
She says.

07:13.000 --> 07:15.950
We will go home now.

07:16.000 --> 07:18.950
Alissa goes with the tall lady.

07:19.000 --> 07:21.950
She is going to a new home.

07:22.000 --> 07:25.000
She is going to be happy.